<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '24px 64px 0' }}>
    {/* A 区 */}
 <Box style={{ height: 96, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'flex-start' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F1423' }}>
 之方法：<span style={{ color: '#FA4F24' }}>业务价值 × 技术健康度二维评估</span>
      </Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#8A8F99', marginTop: 8 }}>
     只看技术健康度会砍掉核心系统，只看业务价值会留下技术债最重的系统——必须两个维度交叉
     </Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#E8E8E8' }} />

    {/* B 区 左标题栏 + 右矩阵 */}
    <Box style={{ paddingTop: 24, paddingBottom: 14, height: 479, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20 }}>

        {/* 左 32% */}
<Box style={{
 width: 320, background: 'linear-gradient(160deg, #FA4F24 0%, #F87D2F 100%)',
      borderRadius: 4, padding: 26, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'space-between',
        }}>
            <Box>
     <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.8)', letterSpacing: 2 }}>STEP 04 · ASSESSMENT</Text>
 <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', marginTop: 14, lineHeight: 1.25 }}>
            二维
       <br />
            评估法
     </Text>
        </Box>
     <Box>
         <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 4, background: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.7)' }} />
   <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.94)', marginTop: 16, lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
     高价值 + 低健康度是最危险的一格：<Text style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>它天天出问题，但没人敢动</Text>。
          </Text>
            </Box>
   </Box>

        {/* 右 68% */}
     <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 18 }}>
        {/* 矩阵 */}
            <Box style={{ width: 420, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
  <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F1423', marginBottom: 10 }}>应用热力矩阵</Text>
   <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row' }}>
     <Box style={{ width: 46, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'space-around', alignItems: 'flex-end', paddingRight: 6 }}>
   {['高', '中', '低'].map((t, i) => (
     <Text key={i} style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8A8F99' }}>{t}</Text>
     ))}
     </Box>
         <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
     {[
    { l: 'A核心', cells: [
     { s: '替换', t: '重构', c: '#FA4F24', tc: '#FFFFFF' },
        { s: '优先', t: '改造成本最高但收益最大', c: '#F8622F', tc: '#FFFFFF' },
     { s: '维持', t: '健康核心，勿折腾', c: '#FBA15C', tc: '#3A2000' }] },
    { l: 'B支撑', cells: [
       { s: '集成', t: '并入核心', c: '#F8622F', tc: '#FFFFFF' },
     { s: '优化', t: '常规演进', c: '#FDC69A', tc: '#3A2000' },
      { s: '收缩', t: '合并入主系统', c: '#D8DCE3', tc: '#3A4050' }] },
     { l: 'C工具', cells: [
         { s: '退役', t: '直接下线', c: '#B8BDC7', tc: '#3A4050' },
    { s: '退役', t: '功能可替代', c: '#D8DCE3', tc: '#3A4050' },
     { s: '清理', t: '数据归档后清除', c: '#F2F3F5', tc: '#8A8F99' }] },
     ].map((row, i) => (
           <Box key={i} style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 6, marginBottom: 6, alignItems: 'stretch' }}>
   <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
     <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#B8BDC7' }}>{row.l}</Text>
      </Box>
         {row.cells.map((c, j) => (
      <Box key={j} style={{ flex: 1, background: c.c, borderRadius: 3, padding: '6px 4px', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
     <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: c.tc }}>{c.s}</Text>
   <Text style={{ fontSize: 10, color: c.tc, opacity: 0.9, marginTop: 3, textAlign: 'center', lineHeight: 1.25 }}>{c.t}</Text>
 </Box>
          ))}
     </Box>
            ))}
     </Box>
         </Box>
     <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8A8F99', textAlign: 'center', marginTop: 4 }}>技术健康度 D → A（差 → 好）</Text>
 </Box>

        {/* 右 判据 */}
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 11 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F1423' }}>两个维度怎么打分</Text>
 {[
        { t: '业务价值（A/B/C）', d: '按承载能力的战略重要度定，与 BA 册的能力重要度直接对齐，不另起一套标准。', c: '#FA4F24' },
   { t: '技术健康度（D/C/B/A）', d: '四项各 25 分：技术栈是否主流 · 是否可维护 · 性能是否够用 · 安全合规是否达标。', c: '#F8622F' },
       ].map((it, i) => (
           <Box key={i} style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', background: '#F7F7F8', borderRadius: 4, padding: '0 16px', borderLeft: `4px solid ${it.c}` }}>
   <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F1423' }}>{it.t}</Text>
  <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#3A4050', marginTop: 4, lineHeight: 1.45 }}>{it.d}</Text>
      </Box>
         ))}
        <Box style={{ flex: 1.2, background: 'rgba(250,79,36,0.06)', borderRadius: 4, padding: '12px 16px', borderLeft: '4px solid #FA4F24', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
     <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#C43A17' }}>最危险的一格：核心 + 差</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#3A4050', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 5 }}>
      它承载核心能力，技术栈又已过保。年年说要改，年年不敢动——最后一定出事。
      这类应用必须排进第一波改造，不能因为「改动风险大」而无限期搁置。
        </Text>
       </Box>
            </Box>
     </Box>
    </Box>

  {/* C 区 */}
<Box style={{ height: 60, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
     <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 14, height: 14, background: '#FA4F24' }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8A8F99' }}>硕磐机密 · AA应用架构咨询方法论</Text>
    </Box>
   <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8A8F99' }}>17 / 30</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>